OL,3,GNEWSA'My mum was run over - now we want
OL,4,Aaction'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA daughter whose mother was hit by a
OL,7,Fmotorbike outside her house in Coventry
OL,8,Fsaid residents are "pulling together"
OL,9,Fto demand safety measures on two roads.
OL,11,FLorette Turner said people living on
OL,12,FWinston Avenue and Monkswood Crescent
OL,13,Fin Henley Green feel ignored after the
OL,14,Fcouncil rejected a petition seeking
OL,15,Fmeasures to tackle speeding.
OL,17,FResidents told the BBC that speeding is
OL,18,Fa persistent problem and fear someone
OL,19,Fcould be seriously hurt or killed if
OL,20,Faction was not taken.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
