OL,3,GNEWSA'My mum was run over - now we want
OL,4,Aaction'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the council said police data
OL,7,Fshowed no recorded personal injury
OL,8,Fcollisions on the roads in the last
OL,9,Fthree years, meaning they do not meet
OL,10,Fthe threshold for priority safety
OL,11,Fworks.
